**/.dockerignore
**/.env
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/docker-compose*
**/compose.y*ml
!**/composer.json
!**/composer.lock
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/vendor
LICENSE
README.md
